flowchart TB
    accTitle: The comments of a contribution
    accDescr: Someone other than the maintainer or a bot comments on, reviews, pushes new commits to, reopens or makes ready for review an issue or a pull request of someone else. One of the maintainer or of a bot, the same event again and an ignored thing end there. A thing that is open names the comment, the review or the news in its message, edited in place, and one message below it in its topic notifies, once for a few quick ones; a draft that the maintainer asked for is written again for a comment or a review, while a text that they wrote themselves stays the draft. A thing whose reply went, or that GitHub dealt with, such as with a request for changes, opens again in its topic with Draft a reply, and an issue that the pager never showed comes as a new thing. When the maintainer comments or reviews on GitHub itself, or the issue or the pull request closes, the thing is done: its buttons go, and its topic gets a check mark.

    asked["`**💬** Someone else comments, reviews, pushes, reopens or marks ready, on an issue or a pull request of someone else`"]
    quiet["`An issue of the maintainer or of a bot, the same event again, or an ignored thing: nothing happens`"]
    open["The message of the open thing names the comment, the review or the news, edited in place, and one message in its topic notifies, once for a few quick ones"]
    draft["`**✍️** A draft that the maintainer asked for is written again for a comment or a review, while their own text stays the draft`"]
    again["`**🙋** The thing opens again in its topic with ✍️ Draft a reply, or comes as a new one`"]
    ended["`**✅** The maintainer comments or reviews on GitHub, or the issue or pull request closes: the thing is done, without buttons`"]

    asked -- "the maintainer's, a bot's, or seen already" --> quiet
    asked -- "its thing is open" --> open
    asked -- "its reply went, GitHub dealt with it, or the pager never showed it" --> again
    open -- "a draft was asked for" --> draft
    open -- "dealt with on GitHub" --> ended

    classDef you fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class asked you
    class quiet,open,draft,again bot
    class ended done
